<https://www.idee.es/csw-codsi-idee/srv/api/records/0b585a7d-30cd-40ad-9551-5e4d61cf2007> a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcatap:applicableLegislation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj> ;
