<https://www.idee.es/csw-codsi-idee/srv/api/records/270e1d8a-c2b0-4cbe-9216-fa99c07440e4> a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcatap:applicableLegislation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj> ;
