<https://www.idee.es/csw-codsi-idee/srv/api/records/4485371d-1fe3-43d9-a96e-497d3ee09d5e> a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcatap:applicableLegislation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj> ;
    dcatap:hvdCategory <http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_af646f5b6>,
