<https://www.idee.es/csw-codsi-idee/srv/api/records/9d6e67b4-7d9c-468f-9a58-aa94e55f3cbb> a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcatap:applicableLegislation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj> ;
