<https://www.idee.es/csw-codsi-idee/srv/api/records/bb612c55-2729-4f31-bf4f-b5e190d74b46> a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcatap:applicableLegislation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj> ;
