<https://www.idee.es/csw-codsi-idee/srv/api/records/f103a46d-c69b-4c05-a403-adf30bc2a06d> a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcatap:applicableLegislation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj> ;
