    dcterms:description "High Resolution Land Cover and Land Use Information System of Spain (HR SIOSE) integrated within the National Plan for Earth Observation (PNOT) whose objective is to generate a database on Land Cover and Land Use for complete Spain, integrating the reference data from the General State Administration, regions and other sources of 2016, 2017 and 2018."@en,
