<https://www.idee.es/csw-codsi-idee/srv/api/records/6b9531c6-4589-41d7-b0aa-58c02e691999> a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcatap:applicableLegislation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj> ;
